#include "guarpfe.h"

EXEC SQL INCLUDE guaorac.c;

/* SZRROLL.RPT                                                         */
/*                                                                     */
/* Academic History Grade Roll report program                          */
/*                                                                     */
/*   Audit Trail: 1.1                                                  */
/*                                                     INIT    DATE    */
/* --------------------------------------------------  ----  --------  */
/* 1. This process was created as an enhancement to                    */
/*    provide an alternative to automatic rolling                      */
/*    of grades to academic history via the SFASLST                    */
/*    Form.  Processing is controlled by a collector    SP   07/01/88  */
/*    table (SZRROLL) whose rows are created by the                    */
/*    SFASLST Form.  After the academic history                        */
/*    tables have been updated, the collector table                    */
/*    row that was processed is deleted.                               */
/*                                                                     */
/* --------------------------------------------------  ----  --------  */
/*   Audit Trail: 1.2                                                  */
/*                                                                     */
/* 1. Fixed problem number 88-6209                      SP   08/03/88  */
/*    Allow all parms to be entered interactively                      */
/*                                                                     */
/* 2. Phase 2 of problem number 88-6209                 SP   09/06/88  */
/*    Removed dummy ASKs; changed table owner of                       */
/*    all tables beginning with 'G' to General                         */
/*    instead of Saturn; added capability of                           */
/*    processing multiple values for a parameter                       */
/*    when job is run interactively - using SPRCOLR.                   */
/*                                                                     */
/* 3. Removed processing of SZRROLL table; now the      SP   09/27/88  */
/*    SFRSTCR table is read and checked for null                       */
/*    grade date and non-null grade code.                              */
/*                                                                     */
/*    Added two new parameters: Report Mode which                      */
/*    can be either Audit or Update, and Print                         */
/*    Selection which can be either All or Errors                      */
/*    only.                                                            */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 1.3                                                    */
/* 1. Changed section seq number to A3 instead of 999.  RM  01/06/89   */
/* 2. Changed SELROLL macro to include section in the                  */
/*    selection and to use the section ptrm code instead               */
/*    of the stcr ptrm code in the where clause.                       */
/*    Also deleted selsect and any refer to it.         RM  01/06/89   */
/* 3. Added table ends to TBODY.                        RM  01/06/89   */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 1.5                                                    */
/* 1. Corrected code for rolling section titles to                     */
/*    history.  Modified code for efficiency.           BR  05/25/89   */
/*                                                                     */
/* 2. Added code for TCP-XXXX.  Courses are now applied                */
/*    to degree when rolled.  If degree does not exist                 */
/*    degree will be created.                           BR  06/12/89   */
/*                                                                     */
/* 3. The registration level code will now be used in                  */
/*    in roll records, not the student level.           BR  06/27/89   */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 1.6                                                    */
/* 1. Corrected code to write revised records to the                   */
/*    grade mailer collector file (SHRGCOL) and update                 */
/*    the term header record (SHRTTRM) when                            */
/*    appropriate.                                      BR  12/04/89   */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 1.7                                                    */
/* 1. Added student campus to insert of SHRDGMR.        BR  07/02/90   */
/* 2. Fixed problem report 89-6389.                                    */
/*    Made the print errors only function to work.      AP  07/07/90   */
/*                                                                     */
/* 3. Rolled the course section attribute along with                   */
/*    the section.                                      BG  08/06/90   */
/*                                                                     */
/* 4. Added primary indicator to roll of instructors                   */
/*    in INSERT_INST macro.                             BR  08/13/90   */
/*                                                                     */
/* 5. Added the SELLGPA, INSERT_LGPA and UPD_LGPA                      */
/*    macros to create or update the SHRLGPA record                    */
/*    with 'N' as GPA calculation indicator.            BG   08/22/90  */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 1.8                                                    */
/* 1. Modified macros SELROLL to select, and INSERT_TCKN               */
/*    to plug in ptrm start/end dates and contact hours                */
/*    for courses defined as ceu sections.              TM   11/29/90  */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 1.9                                                    */
/* 1.  Modified to pass SSBSECT_SCHD_CODE to SHRTCKN.   AP   02/11/91  */
/* 2.  Modified insert of SHRGCOL to put 'O' in request                */
/*     type for original grade mailer requested.        AP   03/04/91  */
/* 3.  Replace SSRINST table by SIRASGN.                BG   03/15/91  */
/* 4. Modified for new job submission standards                        */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 1.10                                                   */
/* 1. Added code the SELGPAC and INSERT_GPAC to insert                 */
/*    campus records by term if needed.                 TD   08/26/91  */
/* 2. Added the SELGPAL, INSERT_GPAL and UPD_GPAL                      */
/*    macros to create or update the SHRGPAL record                    */
/*    with 'N' as GPA calculation indicator.            TD   08/26/91  */
/* 3. Added check for catalog overrides on college                     */
/*    code, department code, division code.             PL   08/29/91  */
/* 4. Increased size of regseq field.                   AR   09/06/91  */
/* 5. Moved delete logic from retrieve parm section     TD   10/08/91  */
/*    because parameter info needed to drive main                      */
/*    select.  Placed delete logic at end of rpt.                      */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 1.11                                                   */
/* 1. Fixed problem 90-6568.  Corrected printing of multiple           */
/*    blank pages during processing.                    BR   02/12/92  */
/* 2. Added insert to SHRCHRT to create cohort records  PL   07/08/92  */
/*    from general student cohorts when the term header                */
/*    record is created.                                               */
/* 3. Added new SHRDGMR fields to insert.               PL   07/08/92  */
/* 4. Removed check to prevent instructor roll when     PL   10/16/92  */
/*    only errors requested to be printed (CSR 92-6322).               */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 2.0                                                    */
/* 1. 93-6082. Prevent fatal oracle error if grade to   RL   07/26/93  */
/*    be rolled already exists in the SHRTCKN table.                   */
/* 2. 93-6084. Ensure all primary curriculum fields are          */
/*    updated on the SHRDGMR record, including minors and              */
/*    concentrations.                                   RL   09/07/93  */
/* 3. Internal CSR. Modify INSERT_DGMR to roll only primary            */
/*    curriculum date fields in SELROLL DECODE statements        */
/*    to prevent compile errors when using full sqlcheck.  RL 07/26/94 */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 2.1                                                    */
/* 1. Removed table owners.                                RL 10/10/94 */
/*                                                                     */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 2.X Supplemental                               JWM  12/12/94  */
/* 1. Program modified by cfix.c to remedy mostly Pro*C related problems:     */
/*    split SQL concatenations joined, colons added to FETCH targets,         */
/*    file extensions added to SQL INCLUDEs, 'static' modifier removed from   */
/*    indicator variables, new logic to hadle CLOSE_CURSOR was added to SQL   */
/*    function wrappers, and object owner references were removed as part of  */
/*    BANNER2.1.  (Not all changes necessarily apply.)                        */
/*                                                                           */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 2.1.5                                                        */
/* 1. Modify Report Control Information header to include        BW 01/19/95*/
/*    Release Number                                             BW 01/19/95*/
/* 2. Modify SYSDATE or sysdate to include century in the        BW 01/19/95*/
/*    heading of the report                                      BW 01/19/95*/
/* 3. Added variables to hold data from the new curriculum      MKH 11/01/94*/
/*    columns in SGBSTDN and SHRDGMR.                                       */
/* 4. Modified SELROLL and SELDGMR to include the new           MKH 11/01/95*/
