/* 7. Added new functionality to retrieve, compare, insert,     MKH 11/01/95*/
/*    and update records in keeping with the new primary and                */
/*    secondary curriculum format.                                          */
/* 8. Added campus code to comparison and update of SHRDGMR     MKH 11/01/95*/
/*    records.                                                              */
/*                                                                          */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 2.1.8                                                       */
/* 1. Expand course number to 5 characters.                     AK 11/21/95 */
/*                                                                          */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 2.1.20                                                      */
/* 1. Modified INSERT_CHRT to include century in the format     CE 08/16/96 */
/*    for sysdate and sgrchrt_activity_date.                                */
/* 2. Updated release number in FOOT.                           CE 08/21/96 */
/* 3. Course Attribute enhancement.                            AMP 02/19/97 */
/*       Added new procedures get_and_ins_attc to store course              */
/*       attributes once, at the CRN level and lock_shrattc for             */
/*       locking new table shrattc.                                         */
/* 4. Removed references for storing course attributes for     AMP 02/19/97 */
/*       each PIDM.  This included removing procedure                       */
/*       insert_attr and modifying procedure lock_tables.                   */
/* 5. Updated release number in FOOT.                          AMP 02/19/97 */
/* 6. Defect #5897. Corrected problem with wrong century       CE  04/29/97 */
/*    being inserted with dates.                                            */
/*       a. Added date format mask to dates being inserted in               */
/*          INSERT_DGMR, INSERT_DGMR1, and INSERT_DGMR2.                    */
/*       b. Added to_char function and format mask to grad date             */
/*          in SELROLL and format mask to ptrm_start_date and               */
/*          and ptrm_end_date.                                              */
/*       c. In INSERT_TCKN, added to_date function and format mask          */
/*          to TCKN_PTRM_START and TCKN_PTRM_END.                           */
/*                                                                          */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 3.0                                                         */
/* 1. Defect #6902. Removed date format mask from sysdate in   CE  07/22/97 */
/*    INSERT_CHRT.                                                          */
/*                                                                          */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 3.0.0.1                                                     */
/* 1. Defect #8319 - "ptrm_start_date and ptrm_end_date don't  BTD 12/10/97 */
/*    get rolled into history for institional course work." I changed query */
/*    selroll so that ptrm_start_date and ptrm_end_date are selected no     */
/*    matter what scbcrse_ceu_ind is.                                       */
/*                                                                          */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 3.1                                                         */
/* 1. Defect #9073. modified  insert_ttrm macro, by adding two more nulls at*/
/*      the end.                                                RS  05/04/98*/
/*                                                                          */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 4.0                                                         */
/* 1. Ptrm, ask_ptrm, and sect_ptrm expanded to 4 characters.   AT 02/15/99 */
/*                                                                          */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 4.1.1                                                       */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 4.2                                                         */
/* 1. All grade roll functionality was placed into a new        JC 07/06/99 */
/*    shared package, SHKROLS.  The package essentially replaces            */
/*    functions SELROLL and TBODY, and all their called functions.          */
/*    Report information is stored by the package in a new table,           */
