/* 1. Defect 87599                                            JKP  02/11/06 */
/*    Problem: Token "YY" exceeds containing column width (1) when          */
/*             printing campus.  Also headers do not print when audit.      */
/*    Fix: Modified tables 3 and 4 definitions to allow for 3 character     */
