/* 2. Defect 106084                                           JKP  02/13/06 */
/*    Problem: SZRROLL is printing the text message, "Rolled to Academic    */
/*       History" a redundant time for each student.  The unwanted second   */
/*       appearance of that same message appears on its own line directly   */
